ve had these measures  in place I would not have to have buried  my son next to his mother a week and a  half ago  the governor is expected to announce  more details of a school safety plan at  a news conference later this morning the  uber driver was contacted by Broward  County deputies and has been cleared of  the investigation Alex  Manuel thanks
 

